{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-63","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与平方与比例","englishTitle":"The square on the major straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the fourth binomial.","book":10,"number":63,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.63","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.63/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":63,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","contentId":"euclid-10-63","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d3a20faf20ff8ad075f0869e0340b53366e5de9b29661732e143579dc3ba544","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-63.statement","euclid-10-63.construction.1","euclid-10-63.construction.2","euclid-10-63.proof.1","euclid-10-63.proof.2","euclid-10-63.proof.3","euclid-10-63.proof.4","euclid-10-63.proof.5","euclid-10-63.proof.6","euclid-10-63.proof.7","euclid-10-63.proof.8","euclid-10-63.proof.9","euclid-10-63.conclusion","euclid-10-63.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-63.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af380cbcc9ff7e1b3b1b15d73ed1c94f5bdb13fe0e6788b10e34116c86b9c53c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the major straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the fourth binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段大直线上的正方形,作为宽度为第四二项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b81d5c1e014a2a3c411f0aee1cea6d203d631f07dbbdb832ca96a8d2adb2a6bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a major straight line divided at C, so that AC is greater than CB; let DE be a rational straight line, and to DE let there be applied the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AB and producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a fourth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为一条主要直线,分为C,AC大于CB;让DE成为有理线段,DE,DE,平行四边形,DF等于AB,DG宽度扩大为正方形;我说,DG是第四条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f05b40f38e9703450a76b53958750b66bcf29a76d3f800c156ce3bcbe8c9bcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the same construction be made as before shown."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"做同样的工程 之前显示。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31cdbff8b6f62c194668c219a31f2d897a04f5fecd70bbe0221e2fb6db91be8b","citations":["euclid-10-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is a major straight line divided at C, AC, CB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial. [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是一条主要直线,分为C,AC,CB是正方形的不可公度直线,有理个直线和正方形个直线,正方形个直线和矩形个直线是中项无理线段个直线。 [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7407a49a7af59f7d33016d288d67e61da2bcf61aa3a1b0db2971e112913ab326","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the sum of the squares on AC, CB is rational, therefore DL is rational; therefore DM is also rational and commensurable in length with DE. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AC为正方形,CB为有理,因此,DL为有理;因此,DM为有理,长度可公度为DE。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a1e3304d33c06d371d7b5fbf283681b0388cff85b746bc8631aea9092e07189","citations":["euclid-10-22","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AC, CB, that is, MF, is medial, and it is applied to the rational straight line ML, therefore MG is also rational and incommensurable in length with DE; [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)] therefore DM is also incommensurable in length with MG. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AC,CB,即MF,是中项无理线段的两倍,适用于有理线段 ML,MG,因此,MG,不可公度,DE,MG,不可公度,MG,不可公度,MG。（相关点与线段：DM） [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76743d02e9d05073e3a96c22f5edb23deb0a5cdc59deb7969f2a031b9ed363b0","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DM,MG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;DG是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32e7899a70396f5fb4298420614a15e96136abce3b3cc909e3cabb5fe8a30f22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that it is also a fourth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"需要证明的是,它也是第四条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0afa22eee3edc4807d1b05740479e08332604bbb6de84baa7fca60a902f97c3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In manner similar to the foregoing we can prove that DM is greater than MG, and that the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与上述情况相似,我们可以证明,DM超过MG,矩形DK,KM等于MN中的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d18bc12327ba77db50cec22c6429aa898fa1170126d6dd18a3d8e6046030296a","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on AC is incommensurable with the square on CB, therefore DH is also incommensurable with KL, so that DK is also incommensurable with KM. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AC对正方形对CB,CB对CB,DH对KL,DK对不可公度对KM [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"665af6779b0a4049596412518e73548d8d17ee247abe25c710408065ddcfd78e","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into incommensurable parts, then the square on the greater will be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with the greater; [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)] therefore the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line incommensurable with DM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果有两条不均的直线,如果数量较大,则对数量较小的正方形适用相当于其第四部分的平行四边形,并有正方形个数字的不足,如果将数量较大的部分分为不可公度个,那么,数量较大的正方形将大于数量较小的正方形,对数量较大的不可公度直线的正方形,对数量较大的不可公度直线的正方形;因此,DM对DM直线的正方形比MG正方形正方形高,对不可公度直线的不可公度和DM直线的正方形。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b836ad7bc4931e21c56b297503d12d6d91cf89f89deeb24ec5c4b009383ffefa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and DM is commensurable with the rational straight line DE set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DM,MG是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,DM是可公度,有理线段、DE已经确定。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"911cdcc6416ac0a8594efb171eef53b277d93238e3042bc37772decbc485c241","citations":["euclid-10-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a fourth binomial straight line. [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第四条二项无理线段直线,证毕。 [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-63.source","contentId":"euclid-10-63","revisionId":"euclid-10-63@raw-6d3a20faf20ff8ad","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea15cc84b668ea90efd94fd0675d207c5d62027e7343603b3f677a2dd5c78d12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.63/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.63\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 